#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "40228"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF is right.\nLet's head back to #C000246204My Room#CDEF now."
msgstr "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF tem razão.\nVamos voltar ao #C000246204Meu Quarto#CDEF agora."

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "40764"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF is right there.\nLet's #C000246204press on#CDEF."
msgstr "#C236196003BB#CDEF está logo ali.\nVamos #C000246204seguir em frente#CDEF."

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "41784"
msgid "We obtained the #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nLet's go back to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and rest."
msgstr "Obtivemos o #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nVamos voltar ao #C000246204Meu Quarto#CDEF e descansar."

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "42076"
msgid "Apocalypse Now!\nCome back soooooooon!"
msgstr "Apocalipse Agora!\nVolte looooogo!"

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "42544"
msgid "Surely you aren't thinking of WALKING back?\nDo you intend to make me march for no purpose?\nLook for that #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF!"
msgstr "Não vai querer voltar A PÉ, não é?\nQuer me fazer marchar à toa?\nProcure aquele #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF!"

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "43456"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF is right.\nLet's head back to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and get some rest."
msgstr "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF tem razão.\nVamos voltar ao #C000246204Meu Quarto#CDEF e descansar."

#. unk_op1659
msgctxt "47684"
msgid "　Obtained\n#C000246204#TITM0001#CDEF."
msgstr "　Obtido:\n#C000246204#TITM0001#CDEF."

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "47728"
msgid "Obtained"
msgstr "Obtido"

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "541580"
msgid "#C236196003Lancer#CDEF's… #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF's lips curl into a smile."
msgstr "Os lábios de #C236196003Lancer#CDEF… de #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF\nse curvam num sorriso."

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "542932"
msgid "And so:"
msgstr "E assim:"

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "543008"
msgid "…the battle concludes."
msgstr "…a batalha se encerra."

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "543232"
msgid "I meet #C236196003Lancer#CDEF's sarcasm with a bit of my own."
msgstr "Respondo ao sarcasmo de #C236196003Lancer#CDEF\ncom um pouco do meu."

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "543392"
msgid "Job's done now, and so is our contract."
msgstr "Serviço feito, e nosso contrato acabou."

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "543724"
msgid "I couldn't bring myself to ask #C236196003Lancer#CDEF what would become of her."
msgstr "Não tive coragem de perguntar a #C236196003Lancer#CDEF\no que seria dela."

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "544124"
msgid "Venus, hear me? Earth's top 100 chart is\nold news. It's all about the galactic charts\nthese days, galactic!"
msgstr "Vênus, está ouvindo? O top 100 da Terra\njá era. O negócio agora são as paradas\ngalácticas, galácticas!"

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "544272"
msgid "Once a fool, always a fool.\nIf I want to become a real idol,\nI have to make a fresh, new start."
msgstr "Tola uma vez, tola sempre.\nSe quiser virar uma idol de verdade,\npreciso recomeçar do zero."

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "544536"
msgid "#C236196003Lancer#CDEF disappears, never looking back once."
msgstr "#C236196003Lancer#CDEF desaparece, sem olhar\npara trás uma única vez."

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "544844"
msgid "\n…and so, my final quest ends."
msgstr "\n…e assim, minha última jornada termina."

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "544904"
msgid "Through #C236196003Lancer#CDEF's help, our one-time enemy,\n    we gained a way to contest #C236196003BB#CDEF―――"
msgstr "Com a ajuda de #C236196003Lancer#CDEF, antiga inimiga,\nobtivemos um meio de enfrentar #C236196003BB#CDEF―――"

